# 01 - Google Jobs with Go

Search Google Jobs API in real-time using Go and SerpApi.

This example searches for "Golang Developer" roles in Luanda, Lisbon, and Remote.

### What you learn

- How to use `engine=google_jobs`
- How to filter by `chips`: employment_type (CONTRACTOR, FULLTIME), location, date_posted
- How to handle pagination

### Run

```bash
go run main.go -q "Golang Developer" -location "Luanda, Angola"